            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7mm Dummy Spindle, Omnia DSP-1</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nReplacement dummy spindle for use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-levers\"><b>Omnia Brass Leversets</b></a> and <a href=\"/collections/omnia-knobs\"><b>Omnia Brass Knobsets</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe spindle that the knob or lever attaches to is 7mm square with a length of 1-1/16\". The mounting plate has a max width of 2-3/8\" and in made from zinc plated steel. These dummy spindles are surface mounted to the face of a door with the included screws.\r\n</p>",
